"Commons Clause" 附加条款是一项对 Apache License, Version 2.0 的补充限制。

The Software is provided to you by the Licensor under the License, as defined
below, subject to the following condition.

本软件由许可人依据下述许可证提供给你，但须满足以下条件：

Without limiting other conditions in the License, the grant of rights under the
License will not include, and the License does not grant to you, the right to
Sell the Software.

在不影响本许可证其他条件的前提下，本许可证授予你的权利不包含、且本许可证
不授予你销售本软件的权利。

For purposes of the foregoing, "Sell" means practicing any or all of the rights
granted to you under the License to provide to third parties, for a fee or other
consideration (including without limitation fees for hosting or consulting/
support services related to the Software), a product or service whose value
derives, entirely or substantially, from the functionality of the Software.

就前述目的而言，"销售"是指行使本许可证授予你的任何或全部权利，以向第三方
提供产品或服务并收取费用或其他对价（包括但不限于与本软件相关的托管或
咨询/支持服务费用），该产品或服务的价值全部或实质上源自本软件的功能。

Any license notice or attribution required by the License must also include this
Commons Clause License Condition notice.

本许可证要求的任何许可声明或署名，也必须包含本 Commons Clause 附加条款声明。

